  The interview algorithm of the question engine (Phase 2.2,
  src/lib/interview/): treat the bible as a decision tree; each round, ask
  the whole frontier of questions whose prerequisites are settled, after
  first removing whatever the document already answers; offer a recommended
  answer with each question; recompute after the answers. Re-implemented for
  Inkquisitor (frontier.ts, plan.ts, round.ts); no code or text from the
  project is copied, and every question text in the packs is written for
  Inkquisitor. The project is distributed under the MIT License, whose text
